Subject: [PATCH 019/192] mac80211-convert-short-fops-to-debugfs-files

Imported from https://github.com/openwrt/openwrt.git package/kernel/mac80211/patches/build/410-mac80211-convert-short-fops-to-debugfs-files.patch (added in 88f4c32060); the patch file carries no author or description.
---
 net/mac80211/debugfs.c        | 27 ++++++++++++++++++---------
 net/mac80211/debugfs_key.c    |  9 ++++++---
 net/mac80211/debugfs_netdev.c |  3 ++-
 net/mac80211/debugfs_sta.c    |  9 ++++++---
